CORE
unquoted-dynamic.sh
--shell-strings native --cvc5 --shell-max-arguments 1
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[shell-argument-count\.[0-9]+\] .*: FAILURE$
^\[shell-unsupported\.[0-9]+\] .* has no \*, \? or \[ .*: FAILURE$
^\[assertion\.1\] .*: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^\[assertion\.[0-9]+\] .*: FAILURE$
--
Unquoted $@ with positional parameters not known during conversion: no
field has a blank or is empty; more fields than --shell-max-arguments,
and parameters with pattern characters, are reported. The solvers take
time that grows fast with --shell-max-arguments.
